        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Knowledge &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Reading Eye</p><p><em>A ring of small dark lenses around the skull, which track independently.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Once per round, <strong>Recall Knowledge</strong> about a creature you can see as a free action.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>When you succeed at Recall Knowledge about a creature, allies gain <strong>+1 circumstance to attacks</strong> against it for 1 round.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>You automatically learn one <strong>resistance, weakness or immunity</strong> of any creature you damage.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Once per encounter, name a creature's <strong>strongest save</strong>; for 1 minute your Mutations target its <strong>weakest</strong> instead.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
